MODULE: RetentionGuardedAdmitsAtTheBound
TARGET: RetentionGuarded
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: retention takes a slot while the retained set already equals the current circulating permits

--- FIND
Retainable(r) == role[r] = "Interactive" /\ Cardinality(retained) < Circulating
--- REPLACE
Retainable(r) == role[r] = "Interactive" /\ Cardinality(retained) <= Circulating
--- END